        DESCRIPTION """This incantation creates a thunderstorm. Every other round a lightning bolt may be called to strike a target, for the duration of the storm. To change targets, the sorceress must make a new casting roll, which acts as her aiming roll. Additional casting rolls have no effect on the spell except for aiming the bolts of lightning.

Ma'at Nux

Foresee the Oncoming Storm"""
    }

